This project runs SimulationCraft; it does not include or link it.
SimulationCraft is a separate work licensed under the GNU General Public
License v3.0 — https://github.com/simulationcraft/simc. `npm run simc:fetch`
downloads an upstream binary and `npm run simc:docker` builds one from upstream
source; neither is distributed as part of this repository.
